💭🔜
  Exchange: NsmEquities
  Gateway: order entry
  Reads: Nasdaq.NsmEquities.Orders.Ouch.v5.0
  Writes: Nasdaq.NsmEquities.MatchingEngine.Ipc.v2026
  Generated. It reads a client's packets and writes each request the venue's transforms name as one of the venue's own messages, which is what the market beside it reads. It numbers the orders it admits from one and finds an order again by the reference its client named it by. It answers nobody: a response goes back to a client this program is not connected to. The packets to read are this program's first argument and the file to write is its second, because Emojicode has no standard input.
🔚💭

